components.example:
```sql
INSERT INTO students (name, city)
VALUES ('小陈', '深圳');

UPDATE students SET city = '杭州'
WHERE id = 3;

DELETE FROM students
WHERE id = 3;
```

INSERT 指定要填写的列，UPDATE 指定新的值，DELETE 指定要删除的目标。

components.code:
let students = [
  { id: 1, name: "小雨", city: "上海" },
  { id: 2, name: "小林", city: "北京" }
];

// INSERT：新增一条完整记录。
students.push({ id: 3, name: "小陈", city: "深圳" });

// UPDATE：先按照稳定的 id 找到目标，再只修改 city。
const target = students.find((student) => student.id === 3);
if (target) target.city = "杭州";

// DELETE：保留 id 不等于 3 的记录，相当于删除测试记录。
students = students.filter((student) => student.id !== 3);

console.log("最后的 students 表:", students);
